{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15068","headline":"归桐庐旧居寄严长史 · 章八元","name":"归桐庐旧居寄严长史","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨辞夫子櫂归舟，家在桐庐忆旧丘。\n三月暖时花竞发，两溪分处水争流。\n近闻江老传乡语，遥见家山减旅愁。\n或在醉中逢夜雪，怀贤应向剡川游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章八元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15068.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15068","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}